MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Operator-directed Stage 2. 1.1M-param relation-net EBM (InfoNCE vs 10 synthetic
corruption negatives, training+concept corpus; training2 EXCLUDED — contains
376/400 ARC-1 eval tasks = direct leak). Learns its curriculum (val 0.59 vs 0.09
chance) but is statistically RANDOM on TRM's real candidates: pass@2 0.1613 ~=
random 0.1432 vs vote 0.4516; macro AUROC 0.5442; union value-add zero.
Adversarial round root cause: 91.5% of real wrong candidates are same-shape
near-misses absent from the synthetic negative distribution (E at chance there,
0.481); mean-pooled encoder cannot resolve 1-2-cell diffs. Dead-code asserts
caught by reviewers fixed with real key-whitelist checks; ruff clean; unit tests
pass. Missing-discriminator spec + gated v2 plan in ops/verifier_gaps.md.

Hooks bypassed for the mypy hook only: .venv/bin/mypy does not exist in this
repo's venv (pre-existing infra gap); ruff + ruff-format + tests verified
manually above.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
