+## 2026-06-09 (GAP-3 Stage-2 v1 — trained generator-independent transition-EBM NEGATIVE, adversarially confirmed (RECIPE not concept) — outer-loop, Claude Fable 5)
+
+- [outer-loop] Operator: "Go with Stage 2." Built + ran the GAP-3 Stage-2 trained generator-INDEPENDENT ARC transition-EBM same-day (design: `docs/research-notes/gap3-learned-arc-energy-design.md` §2 Stage 2, with the Stage-1 corrigendum constraints: grid CONTENT only, no augmentation pooling, grouped folds, union baseline-to-beat).
+- **Split-hygiene audit (load-bearing):** `arc-agi_training2` (ARC-AGI-2 train) contains **376/400 ARC-1 evaluation tasks — including 29/30 of our eval-pool tasks** — and was EXCLUDED from training. Clean corpus = ARC-1 training (400) + ConceptARC (160) = 560 tasks, zero pool overlap (asserted at train time), incidentally TRM arc_v1's own training universe (symmetric, eval-split held out from both generator and verifier).
+- **Build:** `scripts/experiments/arc3_gap3_stage2_export_grids.py` (eval pool with grids: 31 entries / 8041 candidates, demos + test inputs + candidate grids, NO gold grids — `results/arc3_gap3_stage2_eval_pool.json.gz`, vote-multiset cross-checked vs the Stage-1 table); `scripts/experiments/arc3_gap3_stage2_transition_ebm.py` (1.1M-param relation-net: shared pair-encoder CNN, rule = mean over demo-pair embeddings, E = MLP([r,p,r·p,|r−p|]), InfoNCE vs 10 generator-independent corruption negatives, task-consistent dihedral+color-perm augmentation); 6 asserting unit tests (`tests/python/test_arc3_gap3_stage2_ebm.py`, all pass).
+- **Run (conductor paused, GPU 1, 222 s train + 8 s eval):** early stop at step 4250, val top-1 0.5903 vs ~0.09 chance — the energy genuinely learns rule-consistency against synthetic corruptions on held-out training tasks. **Zero-shot on TRM's real pool: NEGATIVE — `results/arc3_gap3_stage2_transition_ebm.json`:** EBM pass@2 0.1613 vs vote 0.4516 (oracle 0.6129); macro AUROC 0.5442; union (votes+q_mean+vote_share) 0.4839 with or without E; shortcut diagnostics ~0 (E is vote-orthogonal — no Stage-1-style leak); bootstrap CI entirely below zero.
+- **Adversarial round (`results/arc3_gap3_stage2_adversarial_verify.json`): unanimous NEGATIVE_CONFIRMED (5/5, worst severity minor), failure attributed RECIPE not CONCEPT.** Every number reproduced bit-for-bit from the shipped checkpoint. Decisive sharpenings (all added in-place as `corrigendum_2026_06_09_stage2`): (1) EBM selection is **statistically indistinguishable from RANDOM** (Poisson-binomial expected pass@2 0.1432, P(X≥5)=0.468); (2) only 3.8% of TRM's real wrong candidates belong to the trained corruption families — **91.5% share gold's shape** (structured near-misses 29.7% + plausible-but-wrong rule applications 59.1%), where E is at chance (0.481) — the EBM ACES its trained families on the real pool (identity-copy dead last, demo-copy AUROC 0.833) and fails exactly where untrained; (3) global mean-pooling cannot resolve 1–2-cell differences (c3202e5a: gold one cell from the vote leader, ranked 747/754); (4) complementarity is structurally impossible (E hit-set ⊂ vote's; Pareto-dominated gold on 4/5 vote-missed entries); (5) the script's no-oracle asserts were dead code (`assert X or True`) — caught by reviewers, FIXED same-day with real key-whitelist checks (property itself held).
+- **GAP-3 ledger after three stages:** scalar (Stage 0) = vote shadow; latent (Stage 1) = vote shadow; trained content-energy v1 (Stage 2) = random on real candidates. The 16pp oracle headroom is real, replicated, and untouched. Missing-discriminator spec logged in `ops/verifier_gaps.md` (same-shape near-miss rule-consistency); Stage-2 v2 spec'd as ONE gated shot (real mined negatives from TRAINING-split + spatial/cross-attention encoder; gate: same-shape near-miss AUROC > 0.70 on held-out training tasks BEFORE any selection eval) — operator decision pending; if v2 lands at random, retire the lineage with the honest bound.
